import PMKAutomaton.ClockSymmetryNormalForm

/-!
# Finite signed-frame and root-word certificates

There are six ordinary D3 reflections, three in each factor, and one product
of two glued-root reflections. They generate Gplus. Central lattice negation,
a product of eight orthogonal E8 root reflections, extends this to Gpm.
The finite word table is a certificate, not a proposed program or mass reading.
It uses the normal form of arbitrary elements of the intrinsic stabilizers.
-/
noncomputable section
